      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It's moderate, honestly.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:33",
      "end_timestamp": "01:35",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, pulse 84, temp 36.7 degrees, pressure 122 over 75.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:28",
      "end_timestamp": "02:36",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]",
        "vital_signs[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Blood pressure and pulse are fine, and there are no breast lumps on examination.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:04",
      "end_timestamp": "03:10",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I've had high blood pressure for about a year now. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I have thin bones. I've had an underactive thyroid, yes.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:57",
      "end_timestamp": "05:12",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[2]",
        "review_of_systems[0]",
        "clinical_conditions[0]",
        "clinical_conditions[1]",
        "clinical_conditions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I mean, years back I got hives from penicillin, so I stay away from it now.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:30",
      "end_timestamp": "05:38",
      "supports": [
        "allergies[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "what medicines are you taking at the moment?",
      "start_timestamp": "05:41",
      "end_timestamp": "05:45",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It's ramipril, 5 milligrams, maybe, every morning.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:46",
      "end_timestamp": "05:50",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, so not with me. I'll bring it next time. Alendronate, once a week for my bones.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:59",
      "end_timestamp": "06:08",
      "supports": [
        "medications[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with perimenopausal symptoms do well once it's treated properly. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had hot flushes for three weeks, severe, and no breast lumps",
      "start_timestamp": "06:48",
      "end_timestamp": "07:03",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "A bone density scan is what I'd like next, for menopause. I'm gonna order blood tests, for irregular periods. Layers of clothing, a fan by the bed, and cutting down on caffeine and spicy food can help the flushes. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:08",
      "end_timestamp": "07:38",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "procedures_and_investigations[1]"
      ]
    },
